            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "BofA & Morgan Stanley earnings, Fed Beige Book: What to Watch",
            "description": "<p>Market Domination Overtime host <a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/author/josh-lipton/\">Josh Lipton</a> takes a look at the top stories for investors to watch on Wednesday, Oct. 14.</p>\n<p>Bank of America (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/BAC\">BAC</a>), Morgan Stanley (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/MS\">MS</a>), United Airlines (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/UAL\">UAL</a>), Synchrony Financial (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/SYF\">SYF</a>), ASML (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/ASML\">ASML</a>), and Abbott Laboratories (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:7;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/ABT\">ABT</a>) all report earnings results.</p>\n<p>Federal Reserve commentary is expected from Atlanta Fed President Raphael Bostic, Fed Governor Stephen Miran, and Fed Governor Christopher Waller.</p>\n<p>The Fed Beige Book will release new economic data in the afternoon.</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more <a data-i13n=\"cpos:8;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-domination-overtime/\">Market Domination Overtime</a>.</p>",
